$487K IN NARCOTICS SEIZED

@CBPSouthTexas USBP agents stopped a drug smuggling attempt Tuesday night, seizing ~600lbs in narcotics. Agents had responded to several subjects loading a vehicle with the drugs but they absconded to Mexico.

Read more: https://t.co/B9Qp74mFrV https://t.co/PKUwewNkiu

